   e.g. now Liverpool (pot 137): Have 4 players aged 30 or over in the squad + Sign a midfielder this season
   e.g. now Chelsea (pot 131): Sign someone 21 or under rated 89 or better + Have 9 players from England in the squad
   e.g. now Manchester United (pot 118): Sign someone 21 or under rated 89 or better + Have 8 players from England in the squad
   e.g. now Tottenham (pot 114): Have 6 players from England in the squad + Have 3 players aged 30 or over in the squad
